pper is tilted back: pointing straight down this high is past the wrist's limit.","q_deg":[-19,71,73,-58,-1,-69]},{"skill":1,"name":"Line up","t0":4.5,"t1":6.0,"grip":"fully open","how":"Twist the gripper so the fingers sit either side of the black handle (a twist of 50 degrees here; keep it under 90).","q_deg":[-19,71,73,-58,-1,-19]},{"skill":1,"name":"Come straight down","t0":6.0,"t1":8.0,"grip":"fully open","how":"Lower onto the handle, straightening the gripper to point straight down for the last few centimetres.","q_deg":[-19,100,82,-72,0,-19]},{"skill":1,"name":"Close all the way","t0":8.0,"t1":9.0,"grip":"closed hard","how":"Squeeze fully on the black handle every time. The model copies how far you close.","q_deg":[-19,100,82,-72,0,-19]},{"skill":1,"name":"Pause","t0":9.0,"t1":9.5,"grip":"closed hard","how":"Stay still for half a second: grip first, then move.","q_deg":[-19,100,82,-72,0,-19]},{"skill":1,"name":"Lift straight up","t0":9.5,"t1":11.5,"grip":"closed hard","how":"Raise about 15 cm without swinging sideways, tilting back as it rises.","q_deg":[-19,72,79,-62,-1,-19]},{"skill":1,"name":"Hold in the air","t0":11.5,"t1":14.0,"grip":"closed hard","how":"Stay still, card visible to the overhead camera. Stop the take here.","q_deg":[-19,72,79,-62,-1,-19]},{"skill":2,"name":"Start holding the card","t0":14.0,"t1":15.0,"grip":"closed hard","how":"Begin where skill 1 ended: card gripped by its handle, held in the air.","q_deg":[-19,72,79,-62,-1,-19]},{"skill":2,"name":"Move above the stand","t0":15.0,"t1":18.0,"grip":"closed hard","how":"Carry the card to about 12 cm above the stand's slot.","q_deg":[26,83,88,-59,0,-23]},{"skill":2,"name":"Line up with the slot","t0":18.0,"t1":19.5,"grip":"closed hard","how":"Twist so the card is parallel to the slot, face toward the guest (40 degrees here).","q_deg":[26,83,88,-59,0,-63]},{"skill":2,"name":"Lower into the slot","t0":19.5,"t1":21.5,"grip":"closed hard","how":"Down until the card's bottom edge sits in the slot, straightening to vertical.","q_deg":[27,112,102,-80,0,-63]},{"skill":2,"name":"Let go","t0":21.5,"t1":22.5,"grip":"fully open","how":"Open fully and wait a moment so the card settles.","q_deg":[27,112,102,-80,0,-63]},{"skill":2,"name":"Lift away","t0":22.5,"t1":23.5,"grip":"open","how":"Straight up 8 cm so the fingers clear the handle.","q_deg":[27,95,95,-70,0,-63]},{"skill":2,"name":"Return home","t0":23.5,"t1":26.5,"grip":"open","how":"Back to the same home pose, then stop the take.","q_deg":[0,52,52,0,0,0]}],"limits_deg":[[-150,175],[0,209],[0,210],[-90,90],[-90,90],[-120,120]],"card":[0.3,-0.1],"stand":[0.33,0.17],"handle_z":0.107,"stand_grip_z":0.125}